# Pipeline INPUTS — the raw photographs the tools/ scripts consume. The app runs
# from the generated assets in kiosk/public/assets/, which ARE committed; these
# heavy source folders are only needed to RE-RUN the pipeline, and the workshop
# keeps them locally.
#
# Anchored to the repo root with a leading slash: a bare `rooms/` would also
# ignore kiosk/public/assets/rooms/ — the room images the app SERVES — and that
# is exactly what left them out of the deploy.
/raw-photos/
/my doors/
/door-handle/
/walls-src/
/wall-scenes/
/rooms/
/demo-doors/
/modern-doors/
/uns-doors/

# contact sheets the tools emit for review
kiosk/tools/_*.jpg
